      "source": "https://www.visitsydneyaustralia.com.au/milsons-pt.html",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Luna Park and North Sydney Olympic Pool sit beside the Harbour Bridge, offering historic entertainment and salt‑water swimming.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
